:: Widgets DoLX Changelog [widget]
<<widget "DoLXChangelog">>
	<div class="changelog-overlay">
		<div class="changelog-hero">
			<span class="changelog-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128220;</span>
			<div>
				<div class="changelog-label">PATCH NOTES</div>
				<h1>DoL X-Change <span>v0.21.2</span></h1>
				<div class="changelog-apk-note"><strong>Official X-Change APK:</strong> Join the DoL Modding server and check the dedicated <a href="https://discord.com/channels/675158131688603721/1512272787572785162" target="_blank">X-Change Channel</a>.</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="changelog-release-link" href="https://gitgud.io/Akoz/dol-xchange/-/releases" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span> View the full changelog and all releases <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
		<h2><span class="changelog-section-icon new" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span> Changes and Additions</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Updated Vanilla to 0.5.12.12</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated RBE to v0.6.1.1</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added pubic hair waxing and sugaring</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Pubic hair can now be waxed or sugared for longer-lasting styles than shaving.</li>
		<li>Available styles are <strong>Bare</strong>, <strong>Landing strip</strong>, <strong>Heart</strong>, and <strong>Triangle</strong>.</li>
		<li>Hair must grow long enough before it can be waxed again.</li>
		<li>Spa members can get a professional intimate wax for <strong>£2,625</strong>, lasting about a month with less pain.</li>
		<li>Home waxing/sugaring kits cost <strong>£15</strong> from the cosmetics shop.</li>
		<li>Passing a Willpower check gives results lasting over three weeks; failing causes a painful, patchy wax that grows back sooner.</li>
		<li>Private spa treatment prices have been reduced to <strong>20% of their previous cost</strong>.</li>
		<li>Spa membership now costs <strong>£15,000</strong> instead of £75,000.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added Eden morning companion scenes</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Eden now gets morning companion treatment similar to Robin and Alex when sleeping together at the cabin.</li>
		<li>Wake-up scenes change with Eden's Love, ranging from bluntly dragging the player out of bed to softer domestic mornings.</li>
		<li>Eden still expects breakfast afterwards.</li>
		<li>The player can choose to <strong>stay in bed a little longer</strong>.</li>
		<li>Nightmares, and other special wake events still take priority.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded Robin's drink stand</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added new events, conversations, and ways to help at the stand.</li>
		<li>Confident players can attract customers while naked instead of carrying the sign.</li>
		<li>Bigger crowds can improve earnings but also increase risk.</li>
		<li>Robin can encounter difficult customers, missing stock, and quieter moments between shifts.</li>
		<li>Once the stand becomes a wagon, the player can help name it for a small income boost.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added the Refrigerator</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Stored food no longer expires while inside it, preserving effects, and remaining shelf life.</li>
		<li>It can be bought from the furniture shop under <strong>Electronics</strong> and placed in the <strong>Orphanage loft</strong> or <strong>Alex's cottage</strong>.</li>
		<li>Orphans may occasionally eat stored food and leave a note, or restock the Refrigerator.</li>
		<li>Avery's mansion kitchen now has one by default.</li>
		<li>Stored food still appears in the <strong>Journal</strong>, counts toward the dish total, and shows where it is stored.</li>
		<li>Removing food restores its preserved remaining shelf life.</li>
		<li>No unique icon yet.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded wardrobe access</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Changing rooms, lockers, and wardrobes now have a <strong>Wardrobe:</strong> row for accessing other available wardrobes.</li>
		<li>Outfits stored elsewhere can be worn at compatible locations such as the lake, beach, and school pool.</li>
		<li>Only wardrobes that normally allow sending and retrieving clothes are shown.</li>
		<li>Restricted wardrobes such as prison and asylum lockers remain unavailable.</li>
		<li>Location-specific wardrobes, such as the mansion wardrobe, only appear when appropriate.</li>
		<li>The <strong>Lake alcove</strong> is now a permanent clothing stash and can be used as an outfit Location.</li>
		<li>Sydney's beach date now uses the normal wardrobe instead of a separate empty changing room.</li>
		<li>Clothes left in the old Sydney beach-date wardrobe are returned to the orphanage.</li>
		<li>Added <strong>Settings &gt; Multiple Wardrobes &gt; Separate, on-site only</strong> for players who prefer the old location-only behaviour.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded World Gender Override</strong>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Female Only</strong> and <strong>Male Only</strong> now affect story narration, dialogue, flashbacks, visions, crowds, and other gendered story text.</li>
		<li>Established story relationships can also be rewritten by the override.</li>
		<li>Underlying events and anatomy are not rewritten, so some overridden scenes may intentionally differ from original canon or read strangely.</li>
		<li>Mickey and Silver Stranger keep their they/them pronouns.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Hair colours</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added <strong>Lemon</strong>, <strong>Mint</strong>, and <strong>Lavender</strong> to character creation and the hairdresser.</li>
		<li>Restored hidden colours including Ebony, Wine, Copper Brown, Frost Blue, Aquamarine, Rose Gold, and Grey.</li>
		<li>Fixed Sexflipped Hair Colour duplicates and missing dyed colours.</li>
		<li>Imported presets now preserve dyed starting hair colours.</li>
		<li>Grey hair no longer gives red feathers after Bird transformation.</li>
		<li>NPC colours such as “darkbrown” now display with proper spacing.</li>
		<li>Unsupported child hair colours are repaired automatically on load.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated the Brothel</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>The brothel auction now unlocks at <strong>300 Prostitution Fame</strong> instead of 500.</li>
		<li><strong>Flirt and offer private company</strong> uses Seduction for moderate pay and a small risk of being grabbed.</li>
		<li><strong>Offer your best sexual service</strong> requires <strong>Promiscuity 4</strong>, uses sex skills, pays the most, and carries a much higher assault risk.</li>
		<li>Each option now has its own scenes and skill-check outcomes that affect pay.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added more Colosseum customisation</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>The player can now choose an arena title or write a custom one.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded Leighton's counter-blackmail</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>The player can now make up to <strong>two demands</strong>, matching the originally intended behaviour.</li>
		<li>Available demands include watch/money, no detention, no health inspections, or the photoshoot resolution.</li>
		<li>Chosen demands no longer appear again.</li>
		<li>Returning for a second demand uses shorter dialogue instead of repeating the original reveal.</li>
		<li>Photoshoot-related demands still require the relevant Fame-blackmail storyline.</li>
		<li>Added <strong>No more health inspections</strong>, permanently preventing all three inspection events during lessons.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded bank cards</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Supported store can now take card payments directly from savings.</li>
		<li>Expand stealing money setting with Normal one, cash theft has a 1–25% chance and card theft has a 5% chance.</li>
		<li>Stolen cards can incur daily charges, capped at £100 per seven days on Normal.</li>
		<li>Reporting a card stolen at HBSC is free and blocks further charges immediately.</li>
		<li>A replacement costs £10, takes 14 days, and must be collected.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expand encounter options</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>While being stalked, the player can throw removable clothing behind them to distract the follower.</li>
		<li>Larger garments create more distance, while small accessories create less.</li>
		<li>Cursed, restraining, covered, or otherwise unavailable clothing cannot be thrown.</li>
		<li>Masks stay on to avoid accidentally revealing identity.</li>
		<li>Thrown clothing is permanently lost.</li>
		<li>The Ivory Wraith ignores the distraction.</li>
		<li>During consensual hand-holding, <strong>Guide them to</strong> can now direct an NPC to the player's chest.</li>
		<li>NPCs can fondle the chest or be asked to use their mouth, leading into normal nipple-play and breastfeeding content.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated sleeping with Gwylan's fox plushie</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added flavour text when cuddling the fox plushie while sleeping in the orphanage bedroom.</li>
		<li>It can reduce Stress and Trauma, with the amount depending on hypnosis depth with Gwylan.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added Bunny fluffy tail mirror option</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Bear eerie items by Bec</strong>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Tweaks and Rebalancing</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Fixed and expanded Autism Spectrum behaviour</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Prayer and container searches are now treated as private.</li>
		<li>Automatic trait text no longer invents conversations, laughter, crowds, or interruptions when nobody is present.</li>
		<li>Public areas and real encounters still keep appropriate crowd and interaction text.</li>
		<li>Sleeping now lowers Masking correctly without adding extra Load or sensory Stress.</li>
		<li>The Masking meter now distinguishes <strong>actively masking</strong> from <strong>recovering</strong>.</li>
		<li>Assessment and documentation progression is more reliable, including older saves and missing assessment dates.</li>
		<li>Existing diagnosis progress is preserved when updating.</li>
		<li>Kylar's cancelled outings no longer count as completed.</li>
		<li>Fixed shutdown text and daily tracking issues.</li>
		<li>Disclosure options disappear once that person already knows about the diagnosis.</li>
		<li>Fishing alone at all five spots now correctly lets Masking decrease.</li>
		<li>Fish and the moor fox do not count as people nearby, while actual visitors do.</li>
		<li>Fixed similar privacy handling for bathing, toothbrushing, and farm showers.</li>
		<li>Teachers no longer repeat disclosure scenes after either completed disclosure choice, including after saving and loading.</li>
		<li>Cancelling still allows the player to try again later.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Autism overload handling</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Overload scenes now interrupt navigation cleanly and preserve Back/history behaviour.</li>
		<li><strong>Carry on</strong> returns to the originally intended destination.</li>
		<li>Harper's card no longer causes the <strong>NPC-Personselect is missing</strong> error.</li>
		<li>Overload scenes wait until free roam instead of interrupting incompatible scenes.</li>
		<li>Recovering cancels queued overload scenes.</li>
		<li>Kylar only intervenes in the school corridor.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Improved Colosseum checks</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Only known baby pregnancies prevent fighting; parasites do not.</li>
		<li>Belly dialogue appears only when pregnancy is visibly showing.</li>
		<li>Injury, drunkenness, comedown, daily fight-limit, rival-match, and self-betting checks now work correctly.</li>
		<li>Colosseum rumours no longer require RNG; they can be heard in the industrial alley from <strong>9 PM</strong>.</li>
		<li>Wins now require enemy HP to reach zero or below; enemy orgasm no longer awards victory.</li>
		<li>Pain incapacitation ends the bout at 100 Pain once Pain Resistance is exhausted.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Omega effects</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Active Omega effects now maintain at least 15 anal Wetness (<strong>a little slick</strong>).</li>
		<li>Higher Wetness from other sources is preserved.</li>
		<li>The minimum disappears when Omega ends.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated school hallway events</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Random hallway scenes now use daily gates, including exposed encounters.</li>
		<li>Viewed events will not repeat again that day regardless of Allure.</li>
		<li>Normal hallway navigation returns once no eligible events remain.</li>
		<li>Allure still influences who certain scenes target.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated relentless Bailey</strong>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Refuse → Fight/Submit</strong> remains available until Bailey Stockholm activates, including intermediate stages.</li>
		<li><strong>Offer yourself</strong> keeps its existing unless the player owes the bank.</li>
		<li>Extreme or Parody inflation blocks <strong>Offer yourself</strong> regardless of Stockholm points.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Bailey desk offer</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Bailey Stockholm can now bypass the size rejection in the crawl-under scene.</li>
		<li>With Stockholm active and Bailey Lust at 50+, bodysize 4+ characters can force themselves through, taking a Pain.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Avery forced pilling</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Avery no longer forces X-Change pills during dates unless <strong>Ignore gender checks</strong> is enabled.</li>
		<li>Otherwise, Avery sends the player to change clothes instead.</li>
		<li>Forced doses now use <strong>NOW-strength</strong>, lasting only for the evening and wearing off by morning.</li>
		<li>The mansion move-in Choice pill is unchanged.</li>
		<li>Updated Avery's “you look too much like me” dialogue.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Sirris's sex shop</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Sirris can remove any locked chastity device, including the chastity parasite with its own removal scene.</li>
		<li>The gold chastity belt remains the only exception.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Jackets and vests are coats now</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Several jackets, cardigans, sweaters, and vests have moved from the Top slot to the Coat slot.</li>
		<li>They can now be worn over shirts and appear under wardrobes' and shops' Coat categories.</li>
		<li>Zipping and unzipping still works as before.</li>
		<li>Old saves update automatically for worn, carried, stored, dropped, and outfit-saved items.</li>
		<li>If another coat is already worn, the moved item is safely sent to the wardrobe.</li>
		<li>Artwork and image paths are unchanged.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Buffed Willpower</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>All positive Willpower gains are now <strong>50% stronger</strong>.</li>
		<li>Willpower losses are unchanged.</li>
		<li>Charlie's dance-class bonus increased from 1 to 2.</li>
		<li>With a subscription, the class bonus increased from 2 to 4.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated character stat tooltips</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Tooltips now show bonuses and penalties together.</li>
		<li>Percentages now match actual skill checks.</li>
		<li>Corrected misleading alcohol, Fatigue, clothing, and transformation labels.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Improved drink safety, sleepwear, and binding</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>High Skulduggery can help detect and avoid spiked drinks.</li>
		<li>Drunkenness and drugs make detection harder.</li>
		<li>Sleepwear is ignored when judging usual presentation.</li>
		<li>Crossdressing/X-Change urges do not bother the player while sleeping.</li>
		<li>Binders, chest wraps, swim shirts, and life vests now affect how others describe the player's chest.</li>
		<li>Being called flat while binding no longer increases insecurity.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Gwylan scratching reactions</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Consensual scratching gives welcoming dialogue and Lust without raising Anger or lowering Trust.</li>
		<li>Works with either hand or both hands.</li>
		<li>Hostile encounters retain their existing reactions.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated anti-pill dealer</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>If the player already has the anti-pill in their medicine cabinet, its chance of appearing again from the shady black-market seller is significantly reduced.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Whitney's visit to Sydney</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added <strong>Punch Whitney</strong> before the glasses are damaged.</li>
		<li>Requires Confident, Flamboyant, Bratty, or Cruel speech attitude.</li>
		<li>Punching Whitney stops the bullying.</li>
		<li><strong>Do nothing</strong> keeps the original outcome.</li>
		<li>Whitney's visit is excluded at high Love and Dominance below 5.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Remy's farm reward dialogue</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Remy now says <strong>good cow</strong> or <strong>good bull</strong> using the existing scene logic.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Fixes and Improvements</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Fixed frozen-scene stat handling</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Flashbacks, frozen scenes, and Hopeless Cycle now correctly pause modded traits, cravings, Stress, recovery timers, bonuses, and notices.</li>
		<li>Normal updates resume when the frozen scene ends.</li>
		<li>Fixed stale-freeze cleanup changing clothing, hair, progress, or previous history.</li>
		<li>Older frozen pregnancy snapshots no longer crash pregnancy checks.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed X-Change virginity history</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Pill expiry now restores the correct original body and its history.</li>
		<li>Virginity history already erased by older versions cannot be reliably recovered.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Avery's car pickup</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed wrong NPC/genital descriptions</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Combat descriptions now follow the enemy who is actually still fighting.</li>
		<li>Scene text checks the NPC's real body instead of guessing from the body part currently in use.</li>
		<li>NPCs with both sets are described correctly.</li>
		<li>Strap-ons count as a cock only when the scene specifically describes what the player can feel.</li>
		<li>Fixed Asylum group scenes checking the wrong orderly.</li>
		<li>Fixed park-shop scenes referring to the customer instead of the shopkeeper.</li>
		<li>Fixed plant virginity taunts checking the first enemy instead of the speaker.</li>
		<li>Fixed brothel escort reveals not recognising NPCs with both sets.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Reduced slowdown during long sessions</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed X-Change Purity warnings</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Pill warnings no longer appear in awkward places or interrupt dialogue.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Avery's mansion chase encounters</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added breathing room after fighting Avery off or triggering traps.</li>
		<li>Corrected escape routes.</li>
		<li>Avery no longer immediately reappears after the player leaves the mansion.</li>
		<li>Chase messages now match Avery's recovery state.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed blush layering</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Blush and blusher makeup now render above the face but behind the eyes to avoid blurry eyes.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Demon skin descriptions</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Blue, purple, red, and automatic Demon skin colours now display the correct colour and tone in character descriptions.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed missing-player reactions no longer only at Bad-End</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>NPCs now treat the player as missing only after they have actually been unseen for at least a week.</li>
		<li>Time spent in public resets the counter.</li>
		<li>Long isolation, such as living in the forest for a month, still counts.</li>
		<li>Brief stays such as a weekend at the farm do not.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed pronouns and related scene routing</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Fixed NPC pronouns across named characters, strangers, and gossip scenes so female and nonbinary characters are not incorrectly called “he”.</li>
		<li>Restored a previously unreachable Wren cottage event where the group can be watched, joined from the window, approached, or left alone.</li>
		<li>Tidied the blackmail-letter sequence in Avery's mansion.</li>
		<li>Fixed missing Harper pronouns.</li>
		<li>Fixed missing Kylar pronouns.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed crowd gender checks</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Audience checks now use NPC pronouns, so women wearing strap-ons are no longer counted as men.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed both cafe baking scenes</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>The old clothing helper no longer adds towels over revealing outfits.</li>
		<li>Clothing now restores normally.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Whitney appearing in class before initialisation</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Gray Pill reactions</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Gray effects are no longer mistaken for genuine body swaps.</li>
		<li>Real body swaps still trigger the appropriate reactions.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed child information</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Transformations now appear in baby details.</li>
		<li>Hermaphrodite babies display the correct gender.</li>
		<li>Children delivered by the player list <strong>Yourself</strong> as the mother.</li>
		<li>Existing children are updated.</li>
		<li>Unknown fathers still display as <strong>????</strong>.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed baby generation</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Tall babies no longer generate with an undefined body size.</li>
		<li>Existing affected babies safely display <strong>Size: Unknown</strong>.</li>
		<li>Fixed a related save-name error.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Robin's gender and pill dialogue</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Robin now recognises when the player is already taking pills.</li>
		<li>Fixed similar dialogue for Robin's nonbinary pill gifts.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Pier music and BulletVibe UI</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed encounter target naming</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Tapes and nipple pasties</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed physique decay</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Sufficient exercise now prevents daily Physique decay.</li>
		<li>Notices distinguish improvement, maintenance at the cap, and decay.</li>
		<li>Fixed a saved cheat value that could overwrite training gains.</li>
		<li>Physique still respects the existing body/talent cap.</li>
		<li>Workouts maintain Physique when already above that limit.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed NNPC save feature</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Magpie's Luck</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed SPA issues</strong>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="changelog-section-icon images" aria-hidden="true">&#10024;</span> Art and Graphics</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Updated DoLP NNPC display</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Removed Female/Male labels from the genderless Ivory Wraith.</li>
		<li>Added a Monster variant for Night Monster so its monster type can be selected.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added Androgynous body slot</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added the vanilla Androgynous body by <strong>Nicoboy (Nicolas)</strong>.</li>
		<li>Added vanilla Modded Face slots 9 and 10.</li>
		<li>Restored the old GooseFem Slender body.</li>
		<li>The current Androgynous body now uses its own Androgynous slot instead of replacing Slender.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Removed True_Doll sprites</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed GooseFem urchin breasts</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Removed Tamagochi pet and boss mini-game icons</strong>
		</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
<</widget>>
